                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bc520997-7bae-3067-95fa-bf1cd27ca44f",
                        "entry_id": "3aedd49a-69cd-3817-90b7-0cc548c846c5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "с угрозой предупредить о чём-либо неприятном"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "76e6a443-7d4b-4631-b2e6-79e186bf966d",
                        "source_entry_id": "3aedd49a-69cd-3817-90b7-0cc548c846c5",
                        "source_sense_id": "bc520997-7bae-3067-95fa-bf1cd27ca44f",
                        "target_lang_word": "threaten",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "threaten",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64bb4f5b-c099-36b9-af0d-53a545d29d30",
                                        "entry_id": "f2cf0a34-36fe-3a92-b00a-bf6c937bcadd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a threat against someone; to use threats."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38dd86b7-8bd7-4dfb-b6ff-834acb0eb994",
                                                "sense_id": "64bb4f5b-c099-36b9-af0d-53a545d29d30",
                                                "text": "No one, however, would have anything to do with him, as Mr. Keeson's orders in those respects were very strict ; he had often threatened any one of his employés with instant dismissal if he found him in company with one of these touts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1ede3a0-4ed9-4b83-88b5-821676f6579c",
                                                "sense_id": "64bb4f5b-c099-36b9-af0d-53a545d29d30",
                                                "text": "\"Taiwanese are very enthusiastic and love freedom and democracy, so many good international friends have come to Taiwan to support us. This is a normal and good thing, but China threatens and intimidates Taiwan,\" she said.\n\"However, I would like to reassure everyone that both our government and the military are prepared, and I will definitely take care of Taiwan.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6d6b338-2089-4a18-8597-56082193fa2b",
                                                "sense_id": "64bb4f5b-c099-36b9-af0d-53a545d29d30",
                                                "text": "He threatened me with a knife."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18716a12-c771-30fb-ae5b-be9fb8bf589e",
                                        "entry_id": "f2cf0a34-36fe-3a92-b00a-bf6c937bcadd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To menace, or be dangerous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb90fcd4-33fd-4a25-9f16-90c302571915",
                                                "sense_id": "18716a12-c771-30fb-ae5b-be9fb8bf589e",
                                                "text": "The rocks threatened the ship's survival."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3de39aa1-d18e-3ccd-bdbe-863157193ae9",
                                        "entry_id": "f2cf0a34-36fe-3a92-b00a-bf6c937bcadd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To portend, or give a warning of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f1cea9f-6514-45d1-b06d-b499a6d39fa9",
                                                "sense_id": "3de39aa1-d18e-3ccd-bdbe-863157193ae9",
                                                "text": "The black clouds threatened heavy rain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ce4e940-e175-3a38-b1cc-113b751c90a2",
                                        "entry_id": "f2cf0a34-36fe-3a92-b00a-bf6c937bcadd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To call into question the validity of (a belief, idea, or viewpoint); to challenge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b75aed42-38c9-467a-a41e-edfb1c00a9e7",
                                                "sense_id": "3ce4e940-e175-3a38-b1cc-113b751c90a2",
                                                "text": "The new information threatened our original hypothesis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d34c4fc6-0691-3bcc-a334-a01e27978100",
                                        "entry_id": "f2cf0a34-36fe-3a92-b00a-bf6c937bcadd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be close to equaling or surpassing (a record, etc.)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70ee3609-697f-4bed-a4cd-a56169116119",
                                                "sense_id": "d34c4fc6-0691-3bcc-a334-a01e27978100",
                                                "text": "The player quickly surmised that things weren't kosher and the suddenly wiser ballplayer threatened the world record for the fifty-yard dash as he sought safety. As Reynolds dived into the van, Dietz and the other players rolled with laughter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2f125c18-ff3b-46a8-b39b-b64e0e254574",
                        "source_entry_id": "3aedd49a-69cd-3817-90b7-0cc548c846c5",
                        "source_sense_id": "bc520997-7bae-3067-95fa-bf1cd27ca44f",
                        "target_lang_word": "minacciare",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "minacciare",
                                "target_lang_code": "it",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf6bf0dd-70cf-3236-befd-8df952e3efef",
                                        "entry_id": "0edc9484-d088-390d-a126-0e662460d1a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "promettere brutte conseguenze se non si fa ciò che viene detto"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c274497c-6798-4e2c-a996-e2e13ffcce99",
                                                "sense_id": "cf6bf0dd-70cf-3236-befd-8df952e3efef",
                                                "text": "Lo minacciò di ucciderne la figlia se non avesse fatto come diceva"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6af43d98-d044-323c-b51d-9859d77becc2",
                                        "entry_id": "0edc9484-d088-390d-a126-0e662460d1a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "fare intravedere un pericolo futuro"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f20e5e91-f0bb-48a3-a712-657d867ac598",
                                                "sense_id": "6af43d98-d044-323c-b51d-9859d77becc2",
                                                "text": "Il mare stava per minacciare burrasca"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45ec3166-256b-3f7f-88b5-39b423525554",
                                        "entry_id": "0edc9484-d088-390d-a126-0e662460d1a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "mettere in pericolo"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0703a2a8-8dbe-4d0e-9fd5-e4c8de154c96",
                                                "sense_id": "45ec3166-256b-3f7f-88b5-39b423525554",
                                                "text": "il salutismo fanatico si associa spesso a ipocondria: se tutti i comportamenti ruotano attorno alla ricerca della salute, capita spesso di credere poi che tutto possa minacciare il proprio benessere"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2adbb64b-b708-3f26-b8f0-ad3379709675",
                                        "entry_id": "0edc9484-d088-390d-a126-0e662460d1a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "atto, anche verbale o tramite gesti del corpo ed azioni, volto ad intimorire o lasciare \\\"circospetti\\\", compiuto per uno o più fini crudeli, anche per eludere da propri difetti, errori e/o mancanze gravi"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d64b482e-c7e2-4d22-a595-0d3863ebb1f4",
                                                "sense_id": "2adbb64b-b708-3f26-b8f0-ad3379709675",
                                                "text": "fingendo, minacciava dicendo: \"...e cosa faresti? Chiami la polizia?!\""
                                            }
                                        ]
